      "m_displayImage1": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_DesertExplorer_A_NPC.dds",
      "m_displayImage2": "",
      "m_clientTags": [],
      "m_genericEvents": [],
      "m_autoQualify": false,
      "m_autoComplete": false,
      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Welcome to Neutralia... or whatever we end up calling it. Can't seem to agree on a name, you see.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_DesertExplorer_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Erasmus_Snifflesworth_NV-CONA_005.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1546272,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I'm afraid all our various worlds have a rather fraught history. Marleybone and Polaris constantly bicker with each other, Monquista with everyone.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_DesertExplorer_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Erasmus_Snifflesworth_NV-CONA_006.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1546272,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "And Valencia once made a mechanical Armada that nearly conquered the Spiral. But we've kept the peace these last few weeks.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_DesertExplorer_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Erasmus_Snifflesworth_NV-CONA_007.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1546272,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "We even agreed on this central meeting point for diplomatic relations. Here you can find the vendors and tradespeople who've funded our voyages.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_DesertExplorer_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Erasmus_Snifflesworth_NV-CONA_008.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1546272,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Not sure where in the Spiral this rock is, but it's over no one's sky. Oh, yes, all the rocks are over different worlds, you see...",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_DesertExplorer_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Erasmus_Snifflesworth_NV-CONA_009.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1546272,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "...Connected via these peculiar gateways which propel a person through the Spiral to here. Come, I'll show you.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_DesertExplorer_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Erasmus_Snifflesworth_NV-CONA_010.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1546272,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "These are the gateways. Through one is the settlement of New Vicorgia. We were the first ones to arrive, as usual.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_DesertExplorer_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Erasmus_Snifflesworth_NV-CONA_011.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1546272,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Pingouins then settled La Ville Rose in the skies of Polaris, while Monquista and Valencia mounted a joint venture to build Puerto Nuovo.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_DesertExplorer_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Erasmus_Snifflesworth_NV-CONA_012.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1546272,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "We've scouted other such Shards, but it seems the worlds in their orbit have not yet discovered a means of reaching them.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_DesertExplorer_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Erasmus_Snifflesworth_NV-CONA_013.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1546272,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC02_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Flee! Flee! This world is a curse! This world is a trap. This world is the tangle in the yarn and the moth that eats through it. Flee for your lives!",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_MonkF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/String_Caster_Fuzhi_NV-CONA_025.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1546270,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Right. You should probably settle your friend there. No sense rocking the skyboat, yes?",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_DesertExplorer_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Erasmus_Snifflesworth_NV-CONA_014.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1546272,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
